<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST-Hungary T-bill yields seen dropping.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Hungary T-bill yields seen dropping.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's discount Treasury-bill yields are expected to fall at this week's auctions, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency will auction one-month T-bills on Tuesday, three-month bills on Wednesday, six-month bills on Thursday and 12-month bills on Friday.</p>
<p>		    ONE-MONTH   THREE-MONTH   SIX-MONTH    12-MONTH</p>
